## Interrupted OAV / temporal verification resolution

The interruption was not a formula-parser truncation: the live parser resolves V7 as one 51-row, 6,000 uL formula. The embedded V7 analysis was a pre-current-runtime result with a malformed `+#` heading and a different confidence outcome. It is now explicitly labeled superseded and preserved.

Fresh exact-byte verification completed on 2026-08-29:

- audit event `aa4036c043ff4c219b306c7278646c2e`;
- formula hash `09677087e2cf83d60124084ba5f191ebb5d6bf2f8ae27ea0c3b1411e8492bae0`;
- 51 material rows and five temporal windows;
- 95 PASS / 31 WARN / 4 FAIL;
- failed gates: `pipeline_preflight`, `physics_data_coverage`, `odt_coverage`, `confidence_minimum`;
- modeled opening vapor 39.84 ppm;
- Caraway contributes no defensible numeric OAV because whole-product MW/logP/VP/ODT authority is missing. Its modeled zero is `MISSING-DATA HOLD`, not dormancy.

The complete fresh formatted analysis is appended to V7 after the retained superseded run.

Additional fresh exact-byte formula receipts:

